sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HR as HR manager
    participant UI as React app
    participant API as API (Express)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over HR,DB: Import (.xlsx with two sheets, or one CSV dataset)
    HR->>UI: Choose a file
    UI->>API: POST /api/imports/validate (multipart)
    API->>API: Check size and type, read Employees and Pay components rows
    API->>API: Validate every row with the shared Zod schemas and the user's country scope
    API->>DB: Look up employee codes and pay component codes
    API-->>UI: Preview: rows to add, rows to update, errors by row and column
    alt File has errors
        UI-->>HR: Show errors, nothing is saved
    else File is valid
        HR->>UI: Confirm import
        UI->>API: POST /api/imports/commit (same file)
        API->>API: Read and validate again
        API->>DB: One transaction: add or update employees, add pay changes with reason import
        API-->>UI: Counts of added and updated rows
    end

    Note over HR,DB: Export
    HR->>UI: Export the current view
    UI->>API: GET /api/exports?format=xlsx and current filters
    API->>DB: Read rows in batches, within the user's scope
    API-->>UI: Streamed file with the same columns as the import
